; A total price becomes a per-unit price first, so the residual is units
; times the rounded per-unit price, not the stated total: asserting exactly
; -10 USD fails.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Euro
2020-01-04 * "total price"
  Assets:Euro  3 EUR @@ 10 USD
  Assets:Cash
2020-01-05 balance Assets:Cash  -10 USD
